{"ordinal":11418,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453986131972","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Death_0eedc95","source":"Bald: …","target":"Bald: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11419,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453986131971","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Death_0ae4381","source":"Bald: Ах ты гнида!","target":"Bald: Jigodie!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11420,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453986131970","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Ears_DontShoot_0b9f91a","source":"Bald: Пиздец…","target":"Bald: Futu-i…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11421,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453986131969","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Ears_DontShoot_0a5f69a","source":"Bald: Теперь-то она мне не почистит уши… с такими пальцами-то…","target":"Bald: Acum n-o să-mi mai curețe ea urechile… cu degetele astea…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11422,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453986131968","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Ears_DontShoot_0020f37","source":"Bald: Я очень любил, когда мне мама уши чистила. У неё получалось очень аккуратно и ни разу не было больно.","target":"Bald: Îmi plăcea mult când mama îmi curăța urechile. O făcea foarte delicat și nu m-a durut niciodată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11423,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937675","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_03b16f4","source":"Bald: А ведь хорошая девчонка была. Симпатичная…","target":"Bald: Și era o fată bună. Drăguță…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11424,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937674","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_096467c","source":"Bald: Это пиздец…","target":"Bald: E de căcat…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11425,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937673","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_0a5b3e8","source":"Bald: Она бухая шла, оступилась, упала в речку и утонула.","target":"Bald: Era beată, s-a împiedicat, a căzut în râu și s-a înecat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11426,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937672","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_0badd9a","source":"Bald: И знаешь что?","target":"Bald: Și știi ce?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11427,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937671","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_09b12c5","source":"Bald: Мы нашли её фотку, распечатали и развесили всюду объявления о том, что она пропала.","target":"Bald: I-am găsit fotografia, am tipărit-o și am lipit peste tot anunțuri că dispăruse.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11428,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937670","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_03c6083","source":"Bald: А потом через несколько дней узнали, что наша подруга, которая домой возвращалась, не дошла.","target":"Bald: Iar câteva zile mai târziu am aflat că prietena noastră, care se întorcea acasă, n-a mai ajuns.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11429,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937669","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_DontShoot_0855c08","source":"Bald: Мы как-то пьянствовали в очередной раз.","target":"Bald: Eram iar la băut împreună.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11430,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937668","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Armpit_DontShoot_00a0fb7","source":"Bald: Это пиздец…","target":"Bald: E de căcat…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11431,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937667","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Armpit_DontShoot_075d67b","source":"Bald: Ты опасный, брат, тем, что можешь решать, кого отправить на тот свет, а кому остаться жить.","target":"Bald: Ești periculos, frate, fiindcă poți hotărî pe cine trimiți pe lumea cealaltă și pe cine lași să trăiască.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11432,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937666","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Armpit_DontShoot_05439dc","source":"Bald: Ну что тут сказать.","target":"Bald: Ce să mai zic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11433,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937665","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_DontShoot_0a80592","source":"Bald: А у меня нихера не осталось…","target":"Bald: Dar eu n-am rămas cu nimic…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11434,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453981937664","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_DontShoot_0587c2a","source":"Bald: Но нет. Так уже несколько лет. А если лечиться, то это явно денег нужно будет много выложить.","target":"Bald: Dar nu. E așa de câțiva ani. Și dacă m-aș trata, sigur m-ar costa o grămadă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11435,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743371","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_DontShoot_0b9a305","source":"Bald: Мне кажется, что я начал сам себя загонять. Мне начало казаться, что у меня зрение пропадает, и вся такая хуйня.","target":"Bald: Cred că am început să-mi bag singur tot felul de idei în cap. Mi se părea că-mi pierd vederea și alte rahaturi de genul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11436,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743370","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_DontShoot_08d3b01","source":"Bald: Хотя писос как страшно сначала было.","target":"Bald: Deși la început m-am speriat al dracului de tare.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11437,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743369","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_DontShoot_00a7389","source":"Bald: Но обосрался я знатно. После этого бросил пить. А то так и сдохнуть можно…","target":"Bald: M-am căcat pe mine de frică. După asta m-am lăsat de băut. Că așa poți să și crăpi…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11438,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743368","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_DontShoot_020b39a","source":"Bald: Хорошо, что ничего жёсткого не натворил. Ушёл в разных ботинках и добрался, куда мне надо было.","target":"Bald: Bine că n-am făcut vreo tâmpenie gravă. Am plecat cu ghete diferite și am ajuns unde trebuia.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11439,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743367","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_DontShoot_0b13c50","source":"Bald: Я аж руки свои нихера не узнавал. Было ощущение, будто я смотрю фильм от первого лица.","target":"Bald: Nici nu-mi mai recunoșteam mâinile, fir-ar să fie. Parcă mă uitam la un film la persoana întâi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11440,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743366","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_DontShoot_0bbc438","source":"Bald: Это был полный пиздец.","target":"Bald: A fost un căcat de proporții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11441,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743365","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_DontShoot_065405d","source":"Bald: Я однажды нажрался до белочки со своими чуваками из театрального.","target":"Bald: Odată m-am îmbătat până am avut halucinații cu băieții mei de la teatru.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11442,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743364","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Teeth_DontShoot_016392b","source":"Bald: Мама иногда даже одежду мне сама шила из остатков тканей…","target":"Bald: Mama îmi cosea uneori haine din resturi de stofă…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11443,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743363","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Teeth_DontShoot_0c34b7f","source":"Bald: Если так подумать, то у нас обычно ни на что, кроме еды, не было особо денег.","target":"Bald: Dacă stau să mă gândesc, de obicei n-aveam bani mai pentru nimic în afară de mâncare.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11444,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743362","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Teeth_DontShoot_0347587","source":"Bald: На лечение зубов тупо денег не было. Хотя, знаешь…","target":"Bald: De tratat dinții, pur și simplu n-aveam bani. Deși, știi…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11445,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743361","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Ears_Gun_01b46b7","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11446,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453977743360","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Ears_Gun_067ba65","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11447,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549067","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Ears_Gun_004105b","source":"Bald: Я же ничего не сделал!","target":"Bald: Doar n-am făcut nimic!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11448,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549066","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_Gun_02dde01","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11449,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549065","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_Gun_0a72600","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11450,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549064","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_Gun_0e0232e","source":"Bald: Может, фотик у тебя какой бракованный, а?","target":"Bald: Poate ai tu un aparat foto defect, ce zici?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11451,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549063","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Photo_Gun_03abc51","source":"Bald: Да ладно тебе! Ч-чё там такое ты увидел?","target":"Bald: Hai, las-o baltă! C-ce ai văzut acolo?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11452,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549062","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Armpit_Gun_0a66f1f","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11453,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549061","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Armpit_Gun_0ddb825","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11454,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549060","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Armpit_Gun_0f81e46","source":"Bald: Ой, да ладно тебе. Всё ж с ними нормально. Не надо мне тут угрожать ружьём!","target":"Bald: Hai, las-o. Sunt perfect în regulă. Nu mă amenința cu pușca!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11455,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549059","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_Gun_00e4e2e","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11456,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549058","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_Gun_043301a","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11457,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549057","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_Gun_0a19b34","source":"Bald: Мне кажется, что тут хуйня…","target":"Bald: Cred că e un rahat minor…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11458,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453973549056","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_Gun_0b69de8","source":"Bald: К доктору, конечно, не пойду, потому что, как говорится: “Хуйня пройдёт, а пиздец не лечится”.","target":"Bald: La doctor, bineînțeles, nu mă duc, fiindcă, vorba aia: „Un rahat trece, dar când ești futut, leac nu există.”","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11459,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354763","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Eyes_Gun_07bef36","source":"Bald: Да ладно тебе, брат! Будет! Я не в агонии какой-то.","target":"Bald: Hai, frate! Ajunge! Nu sunt în agonie.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11460,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354762","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_Gun_0c83177","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11461,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354761","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_Gun_0a6b50c","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11462,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354760","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_Gun_085163a","source":"Bald: Нет пластыря, и не надо. Хуй с ним.","target":"Bald: N-ai plasture? Nu-i nimic. Dă-l dracului.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11463,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354759","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Hands_Gun_03a9b89","source":"Bald: Ладно-л-л-ладно. Чего ты пушку-то сразу наставил?","target":"Bald: Bine-b-bine. De ce-ai îndreptat imediat arma spre mine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11464,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354758","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Teeth_Gun_005c8e7","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11465,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354757","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Teeth_Gun_0ef6c2e","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11466,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354756","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Teeth_Gun_0f704e1","source":"Bald: Эй, братан, ты что? Давай, не шути так. Нормально же общались…","target":"Bald: Hei, frate, ce faci? Hai, nu glumi așa. Doar vorbeam omenește…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-291.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11467,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354755","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Ears_0efc3c7","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11468,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453969354754","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bald_Ears_099f837","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
